    "title": "Jury finds man guilty in May 2023 Palm Beach chase killing - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Justin Backer ,\n6 hours ago PALM BEACH COUNTY, Fla. (CBS12) — A man has been found guilty for his role in a May 2023 murder, according to the Palm Beach County State Attorney’s Office. Palm Beach County State Attorney Alexcia Cox announced that a jury found Quinton Henderson Jr. guilty of first-degree murder and attempted second-degree murder. Read full article",
